Description:It is your first main phase. You control Furtive Homunculus (2/1, skulk) and an untapped Forest, and have Giant Growth in hand. The opponent is at 5 life and controls an untapped Hill Giant (3/3). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-skulk-pump-after-blocks | Skulk is checked only when blockers are declared: a creature with skulk can't be blocked by creatures with greater power (CR 702.118b, 509.1b): attack as a 2/1 the Giant can't block, then Giant Growth after blockers for 5; pumped before blocks, the 5/4 can be blocked by the Giant
